# 🚀 Cognizant Digital Nurture 5.0 – Java Full Stack Engineer (Deep Skilling)

Welcome to my **Cognizant Digital Nurture 5.0 – Java Full Stack Engineer (FSE)** repository.

This repository contains all the weekly hands-on exercises, coding assignments, and mini projects completed during the Deep Skilling program. The learning journey covers backend development, frontend technologies, database programming, testing, microservices, and version control following industry best practices.

---

## 📌 Program Information

| Item | Details |
|------|---------|
| Program | Cognizant Digital Nurture 5.0 – Deep Skilling |
| Track | Java Full Stack Engineer |
| Duration | 7 Weeks |
| Language | Java |
| Repository Type | Weekly Hands-on Exercises & Projects |

---

# 📚 Learning Journey

## Week 1 – Software Design & Programming Foundations

### Design Patterns
- Singleton Pattern
- Factory Method Pattern

**Skills Developed**
- Object-oriented design
- Reusable software architecture
- Loose coupling
- Creational design patterns

---

### Data Structures & Algorithms

Covered concepts including:

- Arrays
- Searching
- Sorting
- Time Complexity
- Space Complexity
- Problem Solving

**Outcome**

Strengthened logical thinking and coding efficiency through algorithm implementation.

---

### Oracle PL/SQL

Topics practiced:

- Variables
- Conditional Statements
- Loops
- Procedures
- Functions
- Cursors
- Exception Handling

**Outcome**

Improved database programming and procedural SQL skills.

---

# Week 2 – Spring Framework

Topics covered

- Spring Core
- Dependency Injection
- Maven
- Spring Boot
- Spring Data JPA
- Hibernate

**Outcome**

Built Java applications using Spring Framework and understood enterprise application development.

---

# Week 3 – REST API Development

Implemented RESTful services using Spring Boot.

Topics included

- REST Controllers
- CRUD Operations
- ResponseEntity
- Request Mapping
- Exception Handling

**Outcome**

Developed backend APIs following REST architecture.

---

# Week 4 – Advanced Spring Boot

Covered

- Layered Architecture
- Validation
- DTO
- Content Negotiation
- API Versioning
- HATEOAS

**Outcome**

Designed maintainable enterprise applications using best development practices.

---

# Week 5 – Microservices

Implemented microservice-based applications using

- Spring Boot
- Spring Cloud
- Configuration Server
- API Gateway
- Service Communication

**Outcome**

Learned distributed application architecture and scalable backend development.

---

# Week 6 – Frontend & Development Tools

## ReactJS

Topics

- Components
- JSX
- Props
